{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "001002af-e74d-8a4f-8f94-94a2ae8b94b8",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T12:14:12-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Stephen Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:04-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:08-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, Denise. Stephen Lawton, I'm over at 317 Old Beach Road, the Easton's Beach side. I'm calling about the water again coming into my yard. Every time it rains it's the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:20-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 317 Old Beach Road. Tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:24-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the water comes down the hill from the next street over, just pours down, and goes straight into my yard. It sits there for days. We had that rain Friday and Saturday, three days ago, and it's still squishy out there. I'm tired of it, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:40-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a lot of runoff for one yard. Is it coming off the road, or is there a drain up the hill that looks clogged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:49-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I can't tell you about the drain, I just know where it ends up, which is me. Oh, and by the way, is that your line that shows up on my phone as the main number? I got a missed call from something this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:12:05-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could be, I couldn't say from here. Let's stay on the yard. Have you got any pictures?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:12:12-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I took a bunch Saturday and again yesterday. The water's running right down the edge of the pavement and across the grass. I can send them to you, whoever you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:12:23-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. I'll have you send those once I've got the request started. Let me get a number in case the crew needs to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:12:32-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:12:34-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 0191. Okay, I'm putting it in as a drainage complaint at 317 Old Beach Road, water coming off the hill into your yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:12:43-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So will there actually be a work order? And what date? Because last time somebody said they'd look and I never saw anybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:12:52-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm opening a work order right now. As for the date, they go out in the order they come in and there's a pile after this rain, so I'd say sometime this week or into the start of next. Someone should come look before they do anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:13:08-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This week or next. Okay. Honestly, I'd like a firm day, but fine. [pause] Sorry, I'm starving, it's lunchtime. All I can think about is a honey dipped doughnut. Anyway, the photos."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:13:19-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honey dipped, can't go wrong. For the photos, the work order will have a reference, and I'll have the office send you where to send them. Or you can bring them by the Public Works counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:13:31-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd rather send them. I'll hold on to them until I hear from somebody. Oh, and one more thing, there's a puddle at the corner by the beach lot that's even worse, but that's not my place, I just noticed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:13:45-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Which corner is that? I can add a note for the crew to look while they're in the area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:13:52-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By the lot entrance, down toward the water. Big one. But my yard is the main thing, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:13:59-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Yard first, corner noted. You're all set, Mr. Lawton. Somebody will be in touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:14:05-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks Denise. I'll be waiting on that call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:14:09-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take care, and enjoy that doughnut."
    }
  ],
